+- Test strategy: pure-logic tests directly against `decide_migration`/`match_chapter_by_name`/`migration_clause` (B1-B4, B6, precedence, token-both-required) plus two `run_with_deps` end-to-end tests via `FakeDeps` asserting `chosen_idx_seen` — pins that the tx call site (not just the pure decision fn) receives the migrated/reset idx.
